   "desc": "It is an API for fetch AE Category's ID and Category Name:\n\n- We export level categories\n\n- We support i18n categories names. Supported languages: hi\nde\nru\npt\nko\nin\nen\nit\nfr\nzh\nes\niw\nar\nvi\nth\nuk\nja\nid\npl\nhe\nnl\ntr \n\n- If you have level 3 category's id or level 4, you can query to parent category info(level 2) from this API\n",
